      <activity id="93740153-2948-5371-9497-cb7e7d8a8022" activityNameId="25b2c7cd-8c0f-50b3-a2a1-15337ba59dc2" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Textile refinement, cotton</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Textile refinement, cotton
Inventory refers to textile refinement of 1 kg  textile or yarn;
UUID: bb6b7bb1-8dd1-353d-8776-d1f8853d82e9
The inventories include energy consumption and material need for the refinement of lint cotton, yarn or textiles including estimations about required infrastructure and waster water treatment.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Bleeching, washing, dying and drying  are the main processes of the refinement which might be applied on lint cotton, yarn or textile . 
Time period: undefined
Production volume:  
Sampling: Data were compiled from literature.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bb6b7bb1-8dd1-353d-8776-d1f8853d82e9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
